<main id="top">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="--rd:0ms">Faith. Growth. Leadership. Impact.</span>
        <h1 class="reveal" style="--rd:90ms">We raise the <span class="accent-red">young leaders</span> Nigeria is waiting for.</h1>
        <p class="sub reveal" style="--rd:170ms">YCDI works in schools and communities across Nigeria, helping young people grow in faith, character and the skills they need to lead well. We've been at it since 2017, and it's still one student, one school, one changed life at a time.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions reveal" style="--rd:250ms">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://hub.ycdinigeria.org/apply" rel="noopener">Apply to Join <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="about.html">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-media reveal-media">
        <div class="frame">
          <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/djy83r6px/image/upload/w_1200,h_1050,c_fill,g_auto,f_auto,q_auto/v1766828679/ycdi-three_pu7ie8.webp" alt="Three smiling YCDI students together outside their school" width="1200" height="1050" fetchpriority="high">
          <div class="hero-script">A brighter Nigeria<br>is possible</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cap">Young people. Real change. A greater tomorrow.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="statbar">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stat"><div class="n" data-count-to="{{ chapters.items | length }}">{{ chapters.items | length }}</div><div class="bar"></div><div class="l">Chapters</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n" data-count-to="{{ chapters.items | uniqueStates }}">{{ chapters.items | uniqueStates }}</div><div class="bar"></div><div class="l">States</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n" data-count-to="{{ stats.reached }}" data-suffix="+">{{ stats.reached | thousands }}+</div><div class="bar"></div><div class="l">Young people reached</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n" data-count-static>{{ stats.since }}</div><div class="bar"></div><div class="l">Serving since</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section who">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="photo"><img src="assets/photos/who.jpg" alt="A YCDI mentor helping a student at a desk" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
        <h2>A Christian NGO that stays long enough to change a life.</h2>
        <p class="body">We believe every young person is made for a purpose. Faith gives them the root, and the right people around them help them grow into it. So we don't just preach at students and leave. We work alongside schools, churches and communities, and we stay long enough to disciple them, mentor them, and open doors they couldn't open on their own.</p>
        <div class="who-lower">
          <div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="about.html">Our Story <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
          <div class="trustcol">
            <div class="ti"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 11-4.5-2.5-8-6-8-11V5l8-3z"/></svg><div><b>Registered Nigerian NGO</b></div></div>
            <div class="ti"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 11a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zm8 0a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zM2 19c0-2.7 3.6-4 6-4s6 1.3 6 4v1H2v-1zm14-3c2.4.3 6 1.5 6 3.9V21h-4v-1c0-1.7-.8-3-2-3.9z"/></svg><div><b>Safeguarding-first</b></div></div>
            <div class="ti"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2h9l5 5v15H4V2h2zm8 1.5V8h4.5L14 3.5zM8 13h8v1.6H8V13zm0 3h8v1.6H8V16z"/></svg><div><b>Independently audited</b></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section prog">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head center">
        <span class="eyebrow">What we do</span>
        <h2>Five ways we invest in young people</h2>
        <p class="lede">From classrooms to communities, we create real chances for young people to grow, lead and serve.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-grid">
        <div class="pcol"><div class="pico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#d70a29" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 1 8l11 5 9-4.1V15h2V8L12 3zM5 13.2V16c0 1.7 3.1 3 7 3s7-1.3 7-3v-2.8l-7 3.2-7-3.2z"/></svg></div><h3>School Outreach</h3><p>Partnering with schools to reach and support students.</p></div>
        <div class="pcol"><div class="pico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f4c400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 11a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zm8 0a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zM2 19c0-2.7 3.6-4 6-4s6 1.3 6 4v1H2v-1zm14-3c2.4.3 6 1.5 6 3.9V21h-4v-1c0-1.7-.8-3-2-3.9z"/></svg></div><h3>Discipleship &amp; Mentorship</h3><p>Walking with young people in faith and life.</p></div>
        <div class="pcol"><div class="pico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#09adea" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="12" width="4" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="10" y="7" width="4" height="13" rx="1"/><rect x="17" y="3" width="4" height="17" rx="1"/></svg></div><h3>Conferences &amp; Leadership</h3><p>Equipping the next generation of leaders.</p></div>
        <div class="pcol"><div class="pico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#d70a29" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h7a2 2 0 012 2v13a3 3 0 00-3-1.6H4V4zm16 0h-7a0 0 0 000 0 2 2 0 00-2 2v13a3 3 0 013-1.6h6V4z"/></svg></div><h3>Scholarships &amp; Academic Support</h3><p>Removing barriers to education.</p></div>
        <div class="pcol"><div class="pico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f4c400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16a1 1 0 011 1v9H3V6a1 1 0 011-1zm-3 12h22l-1.5 2.5h-19L1 17z"/></svg></div><h3>Digital Ministry</h3><p>Using technology to reach, teach and mobilise young people.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section rooted">
    <div class="wrap rooted-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Rooted and Rising</span>
        <h2>A discipleship journey for life and beyond.</h2>
        <p class="intro">Our Rooted and Rising framework helps young people take a clear next step, from first contact all the way to multiplying impact in their own communities.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-white" href="what-we-do.html#pathway">Explore the Journey <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="journey">
        <div class="jstep"><div class="circle"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 21c0-8 5-13 14-14-1 9-6 14-14 14z"/></svg></div><div class="num">01</div><h4>Contact</h4><p>We meet young people where they are.</p></div>
        <div class="jstep"><div class="circle"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 11a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zm8 0a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zM2 19c0-2.7 3.6-4 6-4s6 1.3 6 4v1H2zm14-3c2.4.3 6 1.5 6 3.9V21h-4v-1c0-1.7-.8-3-2-3.9z"/></svg></div><div class="num">02</div><h4>Connect</h4><p>We build relationships and community.</p></div>
        <div class="jstep"><div class="circle"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21S4 14 4 8.6A3.6 3.6 0 0110.6 6c.6.6 1 .9 1.4 1.6.4-.7.8-1 1.4-1.6A3.6 3.6 0 0120 8.6C20 14 12 21 12 21z"/></svg></div><div class="num">03</div><h4>Commit</h4><p>We encourage a personal commitment to Christ.</p></div>
        <div class="jstep"><div class="circle"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l6 6h-4v8h-4V9H6l6-6z"/></svg></div><div class="num">04</div><h4>Grow</h4><p>We help them develop and use their gifts.</p></div>
        <div class="jstep"><div class="circle"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8a3 3 0 10-2.8-4H15a3 3 0 00-.2 1.2L8.9 8.4a3 3 0 100 7.2l5.9 3.2a3 3 0 10.9-1.7l-5.9-3.2a3 3 0 000-1.8l5.9-3.2A3 3 0 0018 8z"/></svg></div><div class="num">05</div><h4>Multiply</h4><p>They go on to impact others in their world.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section stories" id="stories">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="center" style="max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Real people. Real stories.</span>
        <h2>Lives are changing.</h2>
        <p class="lede">From academic support to spiritual growth and practical skills, young people across Nigeria are stepping into a different future through YCDI.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tgrid">
        {% for t in testimonials.items %}
        <div class="tcard">
          <p class="quote">{{ t.quote }}</p>
          <div class="who"><img class="tavatar" src="{{ t.photo or '/assets/photos/placeholder-person.svg' }}" alt="{{ t.name }}" loading="lazy"><span class="wtext"><b>{{ t.name }}</b><span>{{ t.detail }}</span></span></div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
        <div class="tcard invite">
          <h3>Your story could be here.</h3>
          <p>If YCDI has made a difference in your life or your child&rsquo;s, we would love to hear it, and share it with your permission.</p>
          <a class="textlink" href="get-involved.html#share">Share your story <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section trust2">
    <div class="wrap trust2-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Built on trust</span>
        <h2>People, purpose and accountability.</h2>
        <p class="body">We take our responsibility seriously, especially when it comes to the safety, wellbeing and future of young people.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="safeguarding.html">Our Policies <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 11-4.5-2.5-8-6-8-11V5l8-3z"/></svg><h3>Safeguarding</h3><p>Safe people. Safe spaces.</p><a class="textlink" href="safeguarding.html">Read more</a></div>
        <div class="pillar"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 11a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zm8 0a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zM2 19c0-2.7 3.6-4 6-4s6 1.3 6 4v1H2zm14-3c2.4.3 6 1.5 6 3.9V21h-4v-1c0-1.7-.8-3-2-3.9z"/></svg><h3>Governance</h3><p>Clear leadership. Sound systems.</p><a class="textlink" href="governance.html">Read more</a></div>
        <div class="pillar"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="12" width="4" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="10" y="7" width="4" height="13" rx="1"/><rect x="17" y="3" width="4" height="17" rx="1"/></svg><h3>Financial accountability</h3><p>Transparent giving. Greater impact.</p><a class="textlink" href="financial-accountability.html">Read more</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section gallery" id="gallery">
    <div class="wrap gallery-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Our people in action</span>
        <h2>The faces behind the work.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Moments from schools, conferences, community outreach and more.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="gallery.html">View Full Gallery <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="ggrid">
        <div class="gitem"><img src="assets/photos/gallery-1.jpg" alt="YCDI students in a school session" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="gitem"><img src="assets/photos/gallery-2.jpg" alt="A YCDI worship and discipleship gathering" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="gitem"><img src="assets/photos/gallery-3.jpg" alt="YCDI students smiling together" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="gitem"><img src="assets/photos/gallery-4.jpg" alt="YCDI members at a leadership event" loading="lazy"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section chapters bg-off" id="chapters">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Our chapters</span>
          <h2>Find YCDI near you.</h2>
          <p class="lede" style="margin:0;">{{ chapters.items | length }} chapters. {{ chapters.items | uniqueStates }} states. One mission.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="chapters.html">View All Chapters <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="chgrid">
        {% for c in chapters.items | withImage | limit(4) %}
        <a class="chcard" href="chapters.html"><div class="ph"><img src="{{ c.image }}" alt="YCDI {{ c.name | before(',') }} chapter" loading="lazy"></div><div class="meta"><div><h3>{{ c.name | before(',') }}</h3><div class="st">{{ c.state }}</div></div><svg class="ar" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section blog">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:4px;">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">From the blog</span><h2>Teaching and notes from the field.</h2></div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="blog.html">Read the blog <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="postgrid">
        {% for post in collections.posts | limit(3) %}
        <a class="postcard" href="{{ post.url }}"><div class="strip"></div><div class="in"><span class="tag">{{ post.data.category }}</span><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p><span class="go">Read article</span></div>{% if post.data.featuredImage %}<div class="pthumb"><img src="{{ post.data.featuredImage }}" alt="{{ post.data.featuredImageAlt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy"></div>{% endif %}</a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section ways">
    <div class="wrap ways-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Find your way in</span>
        <h2>There&rsquo;s a place for you here.</h2>
        <p class="body">Whether you want to serve, partner, give or pray, there is a meaningful way to be part of YCDI.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="waygrid">
        <a class="waycard" href="get-involved.html#volunteer"><div class="wico"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#d70a29" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 00-7 7c0 5 7 13 7 13s7-8 7-13a7 7 0 00-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1112 6a2.5 2.5 0 010 5.5z"/></svg></div><h4>I want to volunteer</h4><p>Use your time and skills to make a difference.</p><span class="go"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        <a class="waycard" href="for-schools.html"><div class="wico"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f4c400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12a4 4 0 100-8 4 4 0 000 8zm-8 8c0-3.3 3.6-5 8-5s8 1.7 8 5v1H4v-1z"/></svg></div><h4>I lead a school</h4><p>Partner with us to reach more students.</p><span class="go"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        <a class="waycard" href="get-involved.html#give"><div class="wico"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#09adea" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21S4 14 4 8.6A3.6 3.6 0 0110.6 6c.6.6 1 .9 1.4 1.6.4-.7.8-1 1.4-1.6A3.6 3.6 0 0120 8.6C20 14 12 21 12 21z"/></svg></div><h4>I want to give</h4><p>Support young people and change lives.</p><span class="go"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
        <a class="waycard" href="get-involved.html#partner"><div class="wico"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#d70a29" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 11a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zm8 0a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6zM2 19c0-2.7 3.6-4 6-4s6 1.3 6 4v1H2zm14-3c2.4.3 6 1.5 6 3.9V21h-4v-1c0-1.7-.8-3-2-3.9z"/></svg></div><h4>I represent a church or organisation</h4><p>Let&rsquo;s work together for greater impact.</p><span class="go"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-off" id="faq">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="center" style="max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
        <h2>Good things to know</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq" style="max-width:820px;margin:26px auto 0;">
        <details><summary>What is YCDI?</summary><p>The Young Christian Development Initiative is a faith-based Nigerian NGO that helps young people grow spiritually, academically and personally. It began in 2017 as the Christian Youth Development Programme and was registered under its current name in 2018.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Who can take part?</summary><p>Mainly students in the secondary and tertiary schools where we run fellowships and mentoring. Anyone who wants to volunteer their time or skills, or partner with us, is welcome too.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does it cost anything?</summary><p>No. Our school fellowships, mentoring and outreach are free to students. The work is carried by volunteers and supported by donations.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is YCDI a church?</summary><p>No. We are a Christian NGO that works alongside schools, churches and communities. We are interdenominational, and we always work with a school&rsquo;s permission.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Where does YCDI work?</summary><p>We run chapters across six states: Edo, Osun, Oyo, Ondo, Delta and Lagos, and we are still growing.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How can I get involved?</summary><p>You can volunteer, invite us into your school, partner as a church or organisation, or support the work with a gift. The <a href="get-involved.html">Get Involved</a> page is the place to start.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section final">
    <div class="wrap final-inner">
      <blockquote class="verse">Let no man despise thy youth; but be thou an example of the believers, in word, in conversation, in charity, in spirit, in faith, in purity.<cite>1 Timothy 4:12 (KJV)</cite></blockquote>
      <div class="cta-right">
        <h2>A greater Nigeria starts with you.</h2>
        <a class="btn btn-white" href="get-involved.html">Join the Movement <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h13M12 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
<footer>
